<title>SPAIN: RALLYING-CATALUNYA RALLY STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-CATALUNYA RALLY STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LLORET DE MAR, Spain 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading standings</p>
<p>after three stages on the first day of the 1,368-km Catalunya</p>
<p>Rally on Monday:</p>
<p> 1. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza   29 minutes 45 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Bruno Thiry (Belgium) Ford Escort Cosworth  29:45</p>
<p> 3. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza 7 seconds behind leader</p>
<p> 4. Freddie Loix (Belgium) Toyota Celica GT4	11 seconds</p>
<p> 5. Oriel Gomez (Spain) Renault Megane		18</p>
<p> 6. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer     21</p>
<p> 7. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Mitsubishi Lancer   23</p>
<p> 8. Patrick Bernardini (France) Ford Escort	 33</p>
<p> 9. Jesus Puras (Spain) Seat Ibiza		    36</p>
<p> 10. Thomas Radstrom (Sweden) Toyota Celica GT4   37</p>
